      * FOCUS TOOL SIMULATION
      * This script simulates basic FOCUS 4GL commands.

      DEFINE DATASET USERS
      DEFINE FIELD FIRSTNAME A10
      DEFINE FIELD LASTNAME A10
      DEFINE FIELD AGE A3

      LOAD DATASET USERS FROM DATA SOURCE

      PRINT FIRSTNAME LASTNAME AGE
      IF AGE GT 30

      HOLD FILE LISTED
      END

      * Note: This is a simulated representation.
      * Actual FOCUS commands run in a Cullinet environment.
